OL,3,GNEWSA'Amazing' donation of 17,000 roses
OL,4,Aboosts charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity which upcycles flowers at the
OL,7,Fend of their shelf life is celebrating
OL,8,Fafter receiving its biggest single
OL,9,Fdonation - 17,000 white roses.
OL,11,FKaren Simpkin, who runs the Flower Box
OL,12,Fcharity in Beverley, East Yorkshire, is
OL,13,Fselling the flowers for 25p a bunch and
OL,14,Fwill be donating all funds to a variety
OL,15,Fof causes.
OL,17,FShe said volunteers spent 11 hours
OL,18,Fgetting the roses, which were donated
OL,19,Fby East Yorkshire wedding company
OL,20,FAmbience Venue Styling, ready for sale.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
